@When "^perform Portfolio Reassignment event on the '([^']*)' trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'portfolio reassignment' for current trade
    And component dynamic action selects portfolio from stored variable 'portfolioReassignment.newPortfolio'
    And submits lifecycle event and waits for page ready

@Then "^the trade details show the updated portfolio assignment$"
    When double click to navigate to trade detail and wait for page ready for stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade detail container is visible
    And the trade remains Live in trade details
    And page trade detail portfolio combobox contains from stored variable 'expectedPortfolio'

@Then "^the portfolio reassignment is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message 'PortfolioReassignment completed successfully'

@Then "^the trade details reflect the td_bf value calculated from the configured PortfolioReassignment formula$"
    When double click to navigate to trade detail and wait for page ready for stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade detail td_bf value is calculated correctly based on configured PortfolioReassignment formula
